OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FIn Rotherham's A&E a patient with
OL,7,     Fa suspected head injury is under
OL,8,     Farrest in the car park. In London,
OL,9,     Fan eye injury from mixing concrete
OL,10,     Frequires action to prevent
OL,11,     Fpermanent damage.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FThe first episode of the new
OL,14,     Fseries features a lipoma so large
OL,15,     Fit may not be safe to tackle under
OL,16,     Flocal anaesthetic, and a woman
OL,17,     Fwho's had alopecia for over 20
OL,18,     Fyears.
