OL,5,G0000 999: Killer On The Line
OL,6,     FThe story of how killer Brian Cox
OL,7,     Ffatally attacked father-of-five
OL,8,     FMark Webb before cleaning up the
OL,9,     Fscene and lying about what had
OL,10,     Fhappened.
OL,11,G0100 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,12,     FIn Birmingham, Barry worries the
OL,13,     Fcondition affecting his hands will
OL,14,     Fstop him doing the activities he
OL,15,     Floves, and Dr Abdul-Razaak lends
OL,16,     Fan ear to David who is suffering
OL,17,     Ffrom depression.
